      "SummaryText": "The 30-30 Gas Plant extracts natural gas liquids, which are stored on site in a pressurized storage tank prior to transport by pipeline to purchaser. The facility is located in an oil and gas field in a rural area of Yoakum County, Texas. In the event of an emergency, emergency plans and planning are coordinated with local emergency officials (e.g., fire department and sherriff) and Yoakum County Local Emergency Planning Committee (LEPC)."
